00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.840
Into the hitting phase: the body leads. Push off with the legs, turn the waist, drop the racket head,

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.440
and imagine breaking through a door in front of you with your shoulder.

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:04.920
On the racket, the left hand leads and straightens; the right hand supports and adds power.

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:09.260
Make sure you hit all the way through the ball; don't pull the racket in early.

