00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:16.300
Don't let the ball get beside your body and cramp you.

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:20.760
Once you have the technical details, we use the machine for three easier hitting drills.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:23.000 line:10%
Ball machine market

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:23.000 line:10%
