00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.860
First, take the racket back and get fully loaded.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:25.680
Keep the left hand on, take the right hand off, and toss the ball yourself.

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:28.440
Hit it as if you were playing a forehand with your left hand.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:32.600
Step two: put the ball machine near the net and repeat the drill.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.500 line:10%
